<title>HONG KONG: Mahattan Card sets HK$400 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Mahattan Card sets HK$400 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Chase Manhattan Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER  MANHATTAN CARD CO LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$400 MLN   COUPON     3MH+45 BP  MATURITY 5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	   ISS PRICE  PAR	  RE-OFFER 99.775</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 3 &amp; 4*    CALLS	YR 3 &amp; 4   REPLIES  18.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	   REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS   HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING    NONE	   SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY HK	     GOV LAW    HK	   PAY DATE MAY 97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     CO-LEAD MGRS HK$30 MLN+ 27 BP ALL-IN 54 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS CHASE MANHATTAN ASIA, JP MORGAN SECURITIES ASIA,</p>
<p>	     AND SCHRODERS ASIA.</p>
<p> NOTES     *SHAREHOLDING MAINTENANCE CLAUSE STATES THAT CHASE</p>
<p>	     MANHATTAN BANK MUST DIRECTLY OR INDIRECTLY HOLD AT</p>
<p>	     LEAST 51 PERCENT OF THE ISSUER OR THE ISSUE CAN BE</p>
<p>	     PUT BACK TO THE BORROWER.</p>
<p>	     *THE ISSUE ALSO CAN BE PUT IF THE ISSUER CEASES TO BE</p>
<p>	     A RESTRICTED LICENCE BANK IN HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
